<title>USA: Target to shut Everyday Hero store.</title>
<headline>Target to shut Everyday Hero store.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Target Stores, a unit of Dayton Hudson Corp, said Wednesday it will close its Everyday Hero prototype store at the Mall of America in August.</p>
<p>The store was one of two Everyday Hero stores and opened in 1992 as part of a test of a new store concept, which has been discontinued, Target said.</p>
<p>The store featured mostly apparel, with pricing similar to Target stores, Target said.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
